{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gumblaster Mayhem is a 3D retro-style first-person shooter game where you, as a player, acquire three different types of guns. They can all shoot gumballs, but each gumball has various colours and behaviours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/934841a35024a94411bde8bf7f1bcead.poster.avif?t=1762975619\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/934841a35024a94411bde8bf7f1bcead.webm?t=1762975619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/934841a35024a94411bde8bf7f1bcead.mp4?t=1762975619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sour mutants are trying to take over the world of Gumblaster Mayhem, known as Sweetopia. The player needs to take down these creatures before it's too late, corrupting different areas with their sourness. The objective of the game is for the player to survive the game for at least 5 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/eeeda2bdd0d1d328e532a7d579e5ac7b.poster.avif?t=1762975619\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/eeeda2bdd0d1d328e532a7d579e5ac7b.webm?t=1762975619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/eeeda2bdd0d1d328e532a7d579e5ac7b.mp4?t=1762975619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Multiple Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Carrying 3 Weapons at once</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Survival Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Pixelated Render Texture and Visual Effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Gumballs Bouncing Everywhere</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015840?t=1762975619","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015840?t=1762975619","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/dd348efe929e9083e13bbb4f21e25e78a2f1da53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762975619","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/dd348efe929e9083e13bbb4f21e25e78a2f1da53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762975619","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gumblaster Mayhem is a 3D retro-style first-person shooter game where you, as a player, acquire three different types of guns. They can all shoot gumballs, but each gumball has various colours and behaviours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/934841a35024a94411bde8bf7f1bcead.poster.avif?t=1762975619\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/934841a35024a94411bde8bf7f1bcead.webm?t=1762975619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steams